        },
        {
            "name": "places/ChIJLemzQ901aDQRH56DkeKXk_E/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNvajhhU0RnEAE",
            "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 years ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": {
                "text": "Stylish cafe for hipsters. If u want some privacy to have conversations with friends then u will have to book the good spots in advance. The rest of the seats are too close n if u wish to talk something personal then won\u2019t be a good choice.",
                "languageCode": "en"
            },
            "originalText": {
                "text": "Stylish cafe for hipsters. If u want some privacy to have conversations with friends then u will have to book the good spots in advance. The rest of the seats are too close n if u wish to talk something personal then won\u2019t be a good choice.",
                "languageCode": "en"
            },
            "authorAttribution": {
                "displayName": "Sara Bellavita",
                "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110592975610302224885/reviews",
                "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI80eXKadT1mCAizG0LDY2bPCUJCmCPk_Jh7SSwPi34rMuZCQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
            },
            "publishTime": "2019-03-05T13:41:34Z"
        },
        {
            "name": "places/ChIJLemzQ901aDQRH56DkeKXk_E/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURRNWVmRTR3RRAB",
            "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 years ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": {
                "text": "The breakfast was very good. I got the bacon omelette, which includes brocollini and mushrooms inside with a heap of oregano and pepper. Also comes with roasted tomato and a few chunks of potato. Really, really good.\n\nThey also provided me with yogurt which I would also recommend.\n\nBut the real reason I came here was to try the coffee. I'm a bit of a snob and hadn't enjoyed anything I tried in Hsinchu all week. Normally I get a latte or cap, but it was really hot out during my trek here so I opted for the iced latte.\n\nAmbience and service were also good. I enjoyed the jazz music and the view from upstairs.",
                "languageCode": "en"
            },
            "originalText": {
                "text": "The breakfast was very good. I got the bacon omelette, which includes brocollini and mushrooms inside with a heap of oregano and pepper. Also comes with roasted tomato and a few chunks of potato. Really, really good.\n\nThey also provided me with yogurt which I would also recommend.\n\nBut the real reason I came here was to try the coffee. I'm a bit of a snob and hadn't enjoyed anything I tried in Hsinchu all week. Normally I get a latte or cap, but it was really hot out during my trek here so I opted for the iced latte.\n\nAmbience and service were also good. I enjoyed the jazz music and the view from upstairs.",
                "languageCode": "en"
            },
            "authorAttribution": {
